        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    beginning_inventory_cost = 1250.00\n    beginning_inventory_units = 200\n\n    purchase_costs = [116.00, 440.00]\n    purchase_units = [20, 80]\n\n    units_sold = 10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_inventory_cost = beginning_inventory_cost + sum(purchase_costs)\n    total_inventory_units = beginning_inventory_units + sum(purchase_units)\n\n    weighted_average_cost_per_unit = total_inventory_cost / total_inventory_units\n    cost_of_goods_sold = weighted_average_cost_per_unit * units_sold\n\n    # Return answer rounded to the nearest cent\n    return round(cost_of_goods_sold, 2)\n```",
